msgstr "Nothing found — try another spelling or a keyword."

msgid "Zurück zum Fächer"
msgstr "Back to the fan"

msgid "Beschluss des Integritätsrats"
msgstr "Decision of the Integrity Council"

msgid "Derzeit ist nichts hervorgehoben."
msgstr "Nothing is highlighted at the moment."

msgid "Meine Region"
msgstr "My region"

