msgstr "Your e-mail address is confirmed — you are now in the qualifying period (§ 4 (4))."

msgid "Ihre Rechte"
msgstr "Your rights"

msgid "KI-Vorschlag — ohne RIS-Prüfung, keine Rechtsberatung, keine Wirkung auf das Verfahren."
msgstr "AI suggestion — no check against the legal information system, not legal advice, no effect on the procedure."

